# Exact source revisions.  linux/ is pinned to LINUX_MAINLINE_COMMIT; the
# hooks kernels are generated worktrees under out/src backed by its object
# store, with patches/test-hooks.patch applied.  The fix trees are listed in
# configs/fix-trees.conf.

